@Policy_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Create a policy
POST {{Policy_HostAddress}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "vin": "1HGCR2F83HA000000",
  "baseMonthlyRate": 150,
  "effectiveDateUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}

### Invalid VIN (returns 400 with code "Policy.VinInvalidFormat")
POST {{Policy_HostAddress}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "vin": "NOT-A-VIN",
  "baseMonthlyRate": 150,
  "effectiveDateUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}"
}
